{"id":"brasero","name":"Brasero","tagline":"Create and copy CDs and DVDs","blurb":"Brasero is a application to burn CD/DVD for the GNOME Desktop.","description":"Brasero is a application to burn CD/DVD for the GNOME Desktop.\nIt is designed to be as simple as possible and has some unique features to\nenable users to create their discs easily and quickly.\n\nBrasero can create, copy and burn Data and Audio CD/DVDs.\nIt fully supports CD-TEXT, multisession and joliet extensions.\nYou can simply drag and drop files from other local applications or from\nremote shared drives to easily burn them to a disc.","developer":"The Brasero developers","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/icons/128x128/org.gnome.Brasero.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-1_752x481@1.png","w":852,"h":545},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-2_224x117@1.png","w":549,"h":287},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-3_752x481@1.png","w":852,"h":545},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Brasero/97abc58bbe8863f32963d6da96fcbc53/screenshots/image-4_752x481@1.png","w":852,"h":545}],"categories":["Audio & Video","Developer Tools"],"tags":["audiovideo","audio","video","discburning"],"license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","platforms":["linux"],"homepage":"https://